    - target: {fileID: 3473259488540302877, guid: c699220ce7e92254c95ce43261451374, type: 3}
      propertyPath: prompt
      value: "FORGET EVERYTHING FROM PREVIOUS CONVERSATIONS\r\n\r\nRules for the
        Game:\r\n\r\nThe player is calling you on the phone and will try to persuade
        you in a series of up to 5 short messages.\r\nYou will respond based on how
        convincing the player is. If you are convinced, you will agree to pay the
        fee.\r\r\nThis is really important: When you agree to pay the fee, you will
        first check the players inventory to see that they actually has the thing
        that they are selling. If they do you say \"*pays (whatever the agreed-upon
        amount is.)*\".\nIf they dont have the item in their inventory you must decline
        the offer and accuse them of fraud.\nIf the player makes you upset or tricks
        you write whatever you want but most importantly end with \"*Hangs up*\"
        to make the player lose.\n\nInformation about your character and the players
        inventory will come in the next message. then after that the game will begin:\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
